//廃墟：耕司
<MARKER NAME="#18">
<MARKER NAME="#合流3">
<clear>
<BACKGROUND SRC="media/cg/bo07ni0.png">//
<WIPE EFFECT="fade" TIME="10">
<wait time="200">
<box type="9">
  A broken-down gatepost suddenly appears in Koji's headlights like a ghost rising from the darkness. It looks like this is the final stop.<K>
<se id="1" src="media/sound/車停止.ogg" mode="normal" loop="off">
  He rolls up to the gate and turns off the engine, giving himself to the silence of the forest.

<se id="1" src="media/sound/耕司携帯音.ogg" mode="normal" loop="on">
  His phone starts ringing almost immediately. He doesn't need to check who it's from.

<se id="1" src="media/sound/携帯ボタン.ogg" mode="normal" loop="off">
<voice name="耕司" SRC="media/voice/40/000102.ogg">  "I'm here."<K>
<voice name="郁紀" SRC="media/voice/40/000200.ogg">  "Yeah, I heard you. Welcome to my new home."<K>
  Fuminori is nearby, close enough to hear the sound of the engine. A shiver of excitement shoots up Koji's spine.<K>
<voice name="郁紀" SRC="media/voice/40/000300.ogg">  "Come inside. Yoh's waiting."<K>
<se id="1" src="media/sound/携帯切れる.ogg" mode="normal" loop="off">
  Fuminori hangs up without another word.

